        "original_id": "9dc6d471-7dbd-5d9f-8ab9-9af0b4353154",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trick-Trick, Proof, Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, Kon Artis, Eminem, Diezel\n- Groups: D12, Goon Sqwad\n- Products: The People vs., Welcome 2 Detroit\n- Places: Detroit, Michigan\n\nFacts:\n- DeShaun Dupree Holton, better known as Proof, was born on October 2, 1973, and was an American rapper and actor from Detroit, Michigan.\n- \"Welcome 2 Detroit\" is the lead single from American rapper Trick-Trick's debut studio album, \"The People vs.\".\n- The album \"The People vs.\" featured guest appearances by Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, D12 members Proof, Kon Artis, and Eminem, and Trick-Trick's brother and Goon Sqwad bandmate Diezel.\n- Proof died on April 11, 2006.",
